OL,3,GNEWSAM&S to fight council's #419k
OL,4,Abusiness rates claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarks & Spencer (M&S) has said it is
OL,7,Fnot liable for #419,000 of unpaid
OL,8,Fbusiness rates linked to its former
OL,9,FLeicester city centre store, a court
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FLeicester City Council is pursuing the
OL,13,Fretailer for an unpaid sum linked to
OL,14,Fthe premises in Gallowtree Gate.
OL,16,FM&S owns the building but closed the
OL,17,Fflagship store in August 2024, and the
OL,18,Fcouncil is seeking payment of
OL,19,Foutstanding business rates from April
OL,20,F2025 to March 2026.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
