OL,3,GNEWSAM&S to fight council's #419k
OL,4,Abusiness rates claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, a hearing at Leicester
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court was told M&S
OL,8,Fintended to defend itself against the
OL,9,Fauthority's claim.
